[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Class 2 Vehicle Gateway Security Requirements

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @vcr_grammar

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document specifies cybersecurity requirements for Class 2 vehicle components: **Vehicle Gateway**.

Class 2 devices are truck modules intended to perform gateway functions (transport, translate, transform, filter, or encapsulate data) between two or more vehicle network segments.

Examples include:
- Onboard Diagnostics Connector Gateway (Central Gateway / CGW) (J1939 SA 39, 17, 44, 49, 50, 77)
- 3rd Party Equipment Gateway (J1939 SA 249)
- Telematics Interface Gateway
<<<

